cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work in a research output, please cite the thesis and the relevant paper(s) below."
title: "SatelliteCV-Paraguay (Yvutu): Multi-Temporal Earth Observation of Paraguay"
abstract: >
  A thesis substrate and Python package comprising six papers on
  deforestation, carbon credit integrity, indigenous land tenure,
  soybean yield, wildlife detection, and air quality forecasting for
  Paraguay, using Hansen GFC v1.11, Sentinel-2 L2A, MapBiomas Paraguay,
  OpenAQ, Verra VCS, and TROPOMI as primary data sources.
type: thesis
date-released: 2026-07-22
license: CC-BY-NC-4.0
